{% endif %}
{% if patterns %}
HOW THIS TEAM HAS DONE THIS KIND OF WORK BEFORE

These patterns were read out of this team's finished issues by a reviewer who looked at the history
first and judged the evidence {{ evidence_strength }}. Reason given: {{ evidence_reasoning }}

They are the most useful thing you have been given. A pattern is not a past feature — it is the shape
this team's work of this kind keeps taking, and that shape transfers to this proposal even when none
of the past features resemble it.
{% for pattern in patterns %}
--- pattern: {{ pattern.name }} ---
  seen in: {{ pattern.evidence_issue_keys | join(", ") }}
  why it applies here: {{ pattern.why_relevant }}
{% for step in pattern.steps %}
